# Permanent redirects for pages that have moved.
#
# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file from the build output
# (Astro copies it from public/ to dist/). One rule per line:
#   /old/path /new/path 301
# Tool pages live at /tools/<category>/<slug>, so recategorizing a tool
# changes its URL. Add a line here whenever that happens, and never remove
# one: other sites link to the old URLs.

# 2026-10: SDK generators moved from design-documentation to sdk-generation.
/tools/design-documentation/fern /tools/sdk-generation/fern 301
/tools/design-documentation/openapi-generator /tools/sdk-generation/openapi-generator 301
/tools/design-documentation/speakeasy /tools/sdk-generation/speakeasy 301
